  "input": {
    "campus": "lianhuajie"
  }
}

### 6. Create Dual-Approval Refund Request (legacy admin refund compatibility)
# Runtime truth: this creates a PENDING_APPROVAL refund_request and returns 202;
# it does not refund the order synchronously.
POST http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/admin/orders/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333/refund
Authorization: Bearer <finance_admin_access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_micropeach": 10000,
  "reason": "Dual-control refund example"
}

### 7. Approve Refund Request As DISTINCT Second Finance Admin
POST http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/admin/refund-requests/44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444/approve
Authorization: Bearer <second_finance_admin_access_token>

### 8. Execute Approved Refund Request (idempotent convergence)
POST http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/admin/refund-requests/44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444/execute
Authorization: Bearer <finance_admin_access_token>


