### 20. CT-02 Replace My Quantized Busy Blocks With TTL (planned)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/groups/55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555/availability/me
Authorization: Bearer <cloud_access_token>
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: availability_put_demo_0001

{
  "ttl_seconds": 604800,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "start_at": "2026-12-01T08:00:00+08:00",
      "end_at": "2026-12-01T10:00:00+08:00"
    },
    {
      "start_at": "2026-12-01T14:30:00+08:00",
      "end_at": "2026-12-01T16:00:00+08:00"
    }
  ]
}

